      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Spreads = lists of values\n\nA spread is a list. `RangeSpread` produces 0,1,2,…,N-1. To use each value individually, wrap a ForEach region around the body — it runs the inside once per element.\n\nHere: 12 rects laid out across the canvas.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
